[6.956181, "o", "/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:742:how the daemon executes shell-requests and exec-requests depending on the shell-\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:743:and exec-options.\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:749:-type exec_daemon_option()      :: {exec, exec_spec()} .\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:751:-type exec_spec()               :: {direct, exec_fun()} | disabled | deprecated_exec_opt().\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:753:-type exec_fun()                :: 'exec_fun/1'() | 'exec_fun/2'() | 'exec_fun/3'().\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:755:-type 'exec_fun/1'() :: fun((Cmd::string()) -> exec_result()) .\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:757:-type 'exec_fun/2'() :: fun((Cmd::string(), User::string()) -> exec_result()) .\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:759:-type 'exec_fun/3'() :: fun((Cmd::string(), User::string(), ClientAddr::ip_port()) -> exec_result()) .\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:761:This option changes how the daemon executes exec-requests from clients. The term\r\n"]
[6.957222, "o", "/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:766:[One-Time Execution](using_ssh.md#one-time-execution) for examples.\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:769:e.g Linux systems. Texts from a successful execution are returned on\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:774:In case of the `{direct, exec_fun()}` variant or no exec-option at all, all\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:783:- **1\\. If neither the [`exec-option`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) nor the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:785:  evaluator is used both for exec and shell requests. The result is returned to\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:788:- **2\\. If the [`exec_spec`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`)'s value is `disabled`\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:790:  present):** - No exec-requests are executed but shell-requests are not\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:793:- **3\\. If the [`exec-option`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) is present and the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:794:  [`exec_spec`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) value =/= `disabled` (the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:796:  The [`exec_spec`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) `fun()` is called with the same\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:801:- **4\\. If the [`exec-option`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) is absent, and the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:804:  default Erlang evaluator is used both for exec and shell requests. The result\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:807:- **5\\. If the [`exec-option`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) is absent, and the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:810:  exec-request is not evaluated and an error message is returned to the client.\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:811:  Shell-requests are executed according to the value of the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:814:- **6\\. If the [`exec-option`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) is absent, and the\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:816:  requests are executed by the default shell, but shell-requests are not\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:817:  executed.\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:825:> The [`exec-option`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) has existed for a long time but\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:831:-type exec_result()  :: {ok,Result::term()} | {error,Reason::term()} .\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:833:Old-style exec specification that are kept for compatibility, but should not be\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:837:-type deprecated_exec_opt() :: fun() | mod_fun_args() .\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:842:It is a channel callback module that implements a shell and command execution.\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh.hrl:846:[`shell`](`t:shell_daemon_option/0`) and [`exec`](`t:exec_daemon_option/0`) are\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh_message.erl:907:         #ssh_msg_channel_request{request_type = \"exec\",\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh_options.erl:431:      exec =>\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh_shell.erl:238:         {exec, ChannelId, WantReply, Cmd} ->\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh_connection_handler.erl:428:                         exec =\r\n/app/workspace/otp_src_27.3.2/lib/ssh/src/ssh_connection_handler.erl:429:                             ?GET_OPT(exec, Opts)};"]
